/steam/apps/1867960/extras/c55894819e1dd79a2b89ce1175b9ecb0.avif?t=1651142471\" width=606 height=356 /></span><br><br>Soul pieces store Michael's memories. Find the pieces and revive your memories. When the time comes, these can help to make the right choice. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867960/extras/5a56a92466148b559b4d2bd78c63e0cc.avif?t=1651142471\" width=616 height=348 /></span><br><br>Look for notes. You may find a bunch of tips inside them on how to survive in this world.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> The game will take around six hours.<br></li><li> The game features four endings available. Pay close attention to details, learn about traits and relationships of characters, and unlock the best possible ending. You will enjoy all this during the gameplay.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867960/extras/06f034b4083911b231bcc13cb418fcb3.avif?t=1651142471\" width=616 height=80 /></span>","developers":["AV"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867960/header.jpg?t=1651142471","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1867960/429199/f53bb016a967cd4f55a3f3c8fbda4b984d7b77f8/1751041091/dash_av1.mpd?t=1641621986","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1867960/429199/f53bb016a967cd4f55a3f3c8fbd